{"id":"a088bed2d10e61da","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-substitution-term.md","title":"Term Substitution","display":"df-substitution-term — Term Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-substitution-term","aliases":["57-df-substitution-term"],"display":"df-substitution-term — Term Substitution","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-constant]]","[[57-df-arity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-substitution-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-substitution-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-term — Term Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c607e2e3c013a11\" href=\"?note=9c607e2e3c013a11\" title=\"57-df-constant\">57-df-constant</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,t_i,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,t_i,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；类型与构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9c607e2e3c013a11\" href=\"?note=9c607e2e3c013a11\" title=\"57-df-constant\">57-df-constant</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x[u/x]\\coloneqq u,\\quad y\\ne x\\to y[u/x]\\coloneqq y,\\quad c[u/x]\\coloneqq c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x[u/x]\\coloneqq u,\\quad y\\ne x\\to y[u/x]\\coloneqq y,\\quad c[u/x]\\coloneqq c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]\\coloneqq f(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]\\coloneqq f(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\quad t[u/x]\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\quad t[u/x]\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入树的唯一解析保证递归唯一；不再把构造分支的变量藏在分支条件中的存在量词下，然后越过作用域引用它们。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-constant","status":"resolved","id":"9c607e2e3c013a11","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-constant]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}$，$t,t_i,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$，$n\\ge1$；类型与构造子见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-constant]]、[[57-df-arity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}$，$t,t_i,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$，$n\\ge1$；类型与构造子见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-constant]]、[[57-df-arity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-constant","status":"resolved","id":"9c607e2e3c013a11","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}$，$t,t_i,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$，$n\\ge1$；类型与构造子见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-term